2025-11-01 21:37:48,169 - app.llm.services - DEBUG - Received response from Ollama: {'model': 'mistral:latest', 'created_at': '2025-11-01T21:37:48.163545Z', 'response': ' {\n    "historical_interest": 5,\n    "cultural_interest": 80,\n    "quirky_interest": 45,\n    "economic_importance": 80,\n    "political_importance": 60,\n    "reasoning": "This article focuses on a current event about an airline recycling uniforms into school uniforms for students in need. While it does not have significant historical content or direct ties to heritage sites and figures (historical_interest: 5), it highlights a cultural aspect of Scotland by demonstrating Scottish values of care, professionalism, and unity being passed on through the donated crew outfits (cultural_interest: 80). The quirkiness comes from the unexpected connection between easyJet\'s uniform refresh and the school uniform project (quirky_interest: 45). From an economic perspective, this initiative demonstrates a significant local economic impact by reducing textile waste and alleviating the financial burden of school uniform costs for families (economic_importance: 80). Politically, it suggests a call for more government-backed community initiatives to support families in need (political_importance: 60).",\n    "synopsis": "Scottish airline easyJet recycles old crew uniforms into school uniforms for students in Luton, providing financial relief and embodying Scottish values of care, professionalism, and unity.",\n    "relevant": true\n}', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'context': [3, 29473, 1763, 1228, 10916, 15276, 4999, 11205, 1122, 1032, 18485, 23365, 1072, 6447, 4999, 16635, 1163, 1032, 14163, 2991, 29501, 3992, 2417, 1658, 1061, 2774, 29476, 8706, 1155, 1673, 1070, 18485, 25639, 4455, 1065, 1040, 3737, 4311, 29493, 6850, 29493, 7432, 29493, 1072, 1567, 6548, 1461, 9855, 1164, 2913, 1065, 1040, 4108, 1072, 6447, 1070, 1420, 1113, 1506, 3707, 3354, 781, 781, 2780, 17584, 1032, 11610, 9615, 29515, 3261, 10