 but it doesn't have major political significance affecting Scotland's future.\n* Synopsis: As mentioned earlier, the story focuses on practical solutions rather than exploring Scottish heritage or culture. It does not have a significant impact on Scottish diaspora or their interests.\n\nThe calculated average score is (20+30+40+15+25)/5 = 23.6/10 ≈ 2.36, which falls below the threshold of 6.0, indicating that this story may not be particularly relevant to Scottish heritage and culture from a diaspora perspective.","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","context":[128006,9125,128007,271,38766,1303,33025,2696,25,6790,220,2366,18,271,128009,128006,882,128007,271,2675,527,42118,3754,9908,369,264,27188,28948,323,7829,20846,449,264,15871,2326,12,3407,2469,41470,71764,10877,482,1274,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,3723,4273,11,7008,11,8494,11,323,1023,5961,889,10519,459,2802,304,279,3925,323,7829,315,872,330,820,3224,11690,52157,264,14595,6742,25,4423,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,2326,11,449,3070,13537,311,19627,11,8173,304,6975,922,279,330,820,3224,1,482,1202,3925,11,7829,11,32006,11,323,19225,26006,430,5030,382,17064,11106,25,6785,1816,2585,26467,304,5457,304,27188,3363,369,1176,892,198,3222,25,3788,1129,2185,870,25380,2445,78211,916,28455,14,3192,19445,5538,23451,1816,4565,9319,3233,81149,49493,2427,14833,37286,12,33637,38043,7394,18236,1116,32220,784,271,17064,9059,320,3983,220,1049,15,23861,997,17111,19033,80069,7469,3109,38,14833,37286,96925,93075,49636,52933,304,1063,5596,315,43997,617,2586,1139,5457,369,279,1176,892,1306,1694,23540,1566,1060,4245,311,264,13942,22143,13,362,4027,1816,2585,10353,320,6897,57,8,574,8967,311,387,304,2035,304,279,3735,62031,939,7052,3158,315,279,3363,1566,6841,4869,433,1550,539,733,8469,439,38,14833,37286,4409,356,3054,699,307,539,4360,279,5897,5406,4460,311,1893,433,304,3403,892,13,1115,1060,16396,57,82,527,304,2035,304,2380,5789,315,279,3363,1389,3735,62031,939,7052,11,25428,276,28607,323,426,3039,7830,1389,304,264,14435,311,44962,19823,927,27