 or implications for Scotland's future mentioned.\n* Reasoning: I chose these scores based on the fact that the article is primarily about current football-related events, which may be of passing interest to diaspora Scots. However, it lacks substantial historical context, cultural significance, and significant economic or political impact.\n\nPlease note that these scores are subjective and intended to reflect my assessment as a neutral AI observer.","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","context":[128006,9125,128007,271,38766,1303,33025,2696,25,6790,220,2366,18,271,128009,128006,882,128007,271,2675,527,42118,3754,9908,369,264,27188,28948,323,7829,20846,449,264,15871,2326,12,3407,2469,41470,71764,10877,482,1274,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,3723,4273,11,7008,11,8494,11,323,1023,5961,889,10519,459,2802,304,279,3925,323,7829,315,872,330,820,3224,11690,52157,264,14595,6742,25,4423,315,27188,38052,5496,304,279,2326,11,449,3070,13537,311,19627,11,8173,304,6975,922,279,330,820,3224,1,482,1202,3925,11,7829,11,32006,11,323,19225,26006,430,5030,382,17064,11106,25,55764,348,34287,25,426,3328,35938,29292,304,28013,198,3222,25,3788,1129,2185,960,9081,916,28455,55134,2971,10866,3487,85590,88,385,30,266,55967,28,70080,5,266,59661,32220,784,271,17064,9059,320,3983,220,1049,15,23861,997,4599,43997,596,1403,1925,9141,19424,3449,520,29514,5294,5657,11,11230,3445,4395,13,2030,19029,706,1070,1027,1778,264,22999,1977,5352,311,264,12790,430,20781,3966,264,11314,5269,13,763,19627,11,994,28013,4131,50244,520,279,14365,315,55764,323,34287,11,433,596,32263,3754,13,1628,11,31445,11,14188,10846,38725,6469,706,1027,2875,315,63355,13,3011,2643,5222,83509,660,311,279,16736,22842,477,1884,4994,19627,596,8792,19671,11,719,304,2478,6560,9919,374,9141,779,17693,56874,1139,279,3674,13354,439,433,374,304,43997,13,1115,892,11,3582,11,1070,596,459,19018,46220,25,2225,19424,527,20558,11,389,323,1022,279,9846,11,520,279,1890,892,13,23150,2225,44120,11934,690,4668,2204,20258,505,994,279,35938,1566,2322,323,51908